  <item>
    <title>自从上班摸鱼后，我的精神状态好多了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66823747077b88831b636862</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66823747077b88831b636862</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jul 2024 04:57:43 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>hey，朋友们，本期依然是和老姚，一起聊聊“职场摸鱼”</span></p><span></span><p><span>✍本期播客你将听到：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="176">02:56</a> &nbsp;关于摸鱼的科学解释</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="342">05:42</a> 摸鱼的方式有哪些</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="436">07:16</a> 领导有哪些动作其实是在帮你解决“谷氨酸”累积</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="467">07:47</a> 职场摸鱼大调查</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="500">08:20</a> 摸鱼有哪些技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="582">09:42</a> 摸鱼不都是工作太累了需要小憩</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">10:12</a> 摸不摸鱼与公司阶段和性质有很大关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="792">13:12</a> 工资开的不够我就要摸鱼？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 下班不走的一定都是在加班吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="975">16:15</a> 为了防止员工摸鱼公司都有哪些手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1296">21:36</a> 员工有什么摸鱼神器防公司手段</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1422">23:42</a> 其实我们很小的时候就在做摸鱼练习了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 领导们其实也摸鱼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2060">34:20</a> 每种观点都有合理地方，希望大家快乐为大</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌹本期嘉宾：</span></p><span></span><p><span>老姚：留美硕士，学的比较小众的养老专业，目前从事适合中国人养老社区的相关工作。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎤本期主播：</span></p><span></span><p><span>芝士：互联网大厂人，深度链接互联网业内各行业专家、整合运营资源、分享干货知识。</span></p><span></span><p><span>蛋白：资深媒体人，全国公益广告奖项“大满贯”，曾专访数十位顶级导演、顶流艺人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>✂后期制作：蛋白</span></p><span></span><p><span>📫如何找到我们：可以私信邮箱729231555@qq.com</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/loI__pZkAD8sxnV4Rq3PNKm0Gmpg.m4a" length="76163019" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:39:26</itunes:duration>
